# Pairs with TypeOK. The allocator stops checking the end of the modelled
# partition, so a fourth write is assigned an offset outside it.
MODULE: TypeOkAllocPastOffsetDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the WAL shard's allocator assigns past the partition's offset domain
PERTURBS: Alloc

--- FIND
    /\ pend[i]
    /\ next < MaxOff
    /\ loaded[i] # Unloaded
--- REPLACE
    /\ pend[i]
\* MUTATION: no bound on the allocator.
    /\ loaded[i] # Unloaded
--- END
